                    "sense_definition": "A small ornamental piece of embroidery worn on ecclesiastical vestments.",
                    "learner_level": "C2",
                    "frequency": "VeryLow",
                    "semantic_group_id": "",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The priest's alb was decorated with a gold <w>apparel</w> at the hem.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "ru": "Стихарь священника был украшен золотым <w>шитьем</w> по подолу.",
                                "de": "Die Albe des Priesters war am Saum mit einer goldenen <w>Parura</w> verziert."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Museums preserve ancient vestments featuring intricate <w>apparel</w> work.",
